# GAWatch Stack

- Stack: React 19 + Vite + react-router-dom (HashRouter) + Bootstrap/react-bootstrap + Mapbox.
- Validate with repository scripts: npm run lint, npm test, npm run build.
- Keep page styles in src/index.css. Keep separate: Navbar.css, SubNavbar.css, Dropdown.module.css.
- Prefer existing component patterns under src/Pages/. Do not invent parallel style systems.
- Data lives in src/data/ JSON. Do not call production APIs in routine tests.
- Smallest complete change. Match local naming and class conventions.
